        "original_id": "ef7088c0-e743-5e2b-9430-5dc372696584",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Ferrari 360, Ferrari F355, Porsche 911, Lamborghini Diablo, Mitsubishi Lancer, Subaru Impreza, HSV\n- Organizations: Ferrari, PROCAR\n- Events: Australian Nations Cup Championship, Australian GT Production Car Championship, Australian Drivers' Championship, Australian Formula Ford Championship\n- People: Mark Noske\n\nFacts:\n- The Ferrari F355 (Type F129) is a sports car built by Ferrari from May 1994 to 1999.\n- Ferrari built the two-seater Ferrari 360 sports car from 1999 to 2005.\n- In 2000, PROCAR split the Australian GT Production Car Championship into two separate series.\n- In 2000, the new Australian Nations Cup Championship was created for more exotic GT cars such as the Porsche 911, Ferrari 360, and Lamborghini Diablo.\n- In 2000, the revised Australian GT Production Car Championship featured lesser vehicles such as the Mitsubishi Lancer, Subaru Impreza, and HSV competing for outright wins.\n- Mark Noske has scored round wins in the Australian Drivers' Championship, the Australian Formula Ford Championship, and the Australian Nations Cup Championship.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "429e283d-3c49-562b-81f4-fd80b71a032b",
        "text": "Page: Ferrari 360. Sentence: The Ferrari 360 is a two-seater sports car built by Ferrari from 1999 to 2005.\nPage: Ferrari F355. Sentence: The Ferrari F355 (Type F129) is a sports car built by Ferrari from May 1994 to 1999.\nPage: Australian Nations Cup Championship. Sentence: For 2000, PROCAR split the Australian GT Production Car Championship into two separate series so that the more exotic GT cars such as Porsche 911s, Ferrari 360s and Lamborghini Diablo's could compete in the new Australian Nations Cup Championship and the lesser vehicles such as the Mitsubishi Lancers, Subaru Imprezas and HSV's could now compete for outright wins in the revised Australian GT Production Car Championship.\nPage: Mark Noske. Sentence: He has scored round wins in various Australian championships including the Australian Drivers' Championship, the Australian Formula Ford Championship and the Australian Nations Cup Championship.",
